    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n65624" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεθίημι</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεθιεῖς</span> (<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
