					Coluth.
					127
				</span></i>
			: other moods from aor. 2, imper. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέθες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>El.</u>
					448
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ec.</u>
				958
			</span></i> (lyr.), etc.; subj.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεθῶ</span>, 
				Ep.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεθείω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					3.414
				</span></i>
			; opt. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεθείην</span>”
